    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Nia, a newly birthed ocean spirit, awakens on the cold, dark seafloor also known as the Abyss. With the ocean in ruin, she embarks on a journey to cleanse the polluted depths, plant the seeds of new life, and restore balance to the Abyss.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Restore the Ocean</strong> \u2013 Remove pollution and clean up trash using Nia\u2019s abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Create a Living Ecosystem</strong> \u2013 Attract and nurture fish with unique behaviors and interactions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Grow &amp; Cultivate</strong> \u2013 Revitalize the seafloor, plant seeds, and unlock new flora in unique ways.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Repurpose the Ruins</strong> \u2013 Destroy remnants of human waste and use the materials to influence the ocean\u2019s evolution.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Uncover Hidden Lore</strong> \u2013 Discover ancient tablets that reveal more about humanity\u2019s past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>A Dreamlike Underwater World</strong> \u2013 Hand-drawn aquatic life meets stylized 3D environments in a soothing, immersive, and melancholic experience.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Nia, a newly birthed ocean spirit, awakens on the cold, dark seafloor also known as the Abyss. With the ocean in ruin, she embarks on a journey to cleanse the polluted depths, plant the seeds of new life, and restore balance to the Abyss.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Restore the Ocean</strong> \u2013 Remove pollution and clean up trash using Nia\u2019s abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Create a Living Ecosystem</strong> \u2013 Attract and nurture fish with unique behaviors and interactions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Grow &amp; Cultivate</strong> \u2013 Revitalize the seafloor, plant seeds, and unlock new flora in unique ways.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Repurpose the Ruins</strong> \u2013 Destroy remnants of human waste and use the materials to influence the ocean\u2019s evolution.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Uncover Hidden Lore</strong> \u2013 Discover ancient tablets that reveal more about humanity\u2019s past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>A Dreamlike Underwater World</strong> \u2013 Hand-drawn aquatic life meets stylized 3D environments in a soothing, immersive, and melancholic experience.</p>",
    "short_description": "Join Nia on her journey to breathe new life into the ocean depths. Clean the seafloor, plant seeds, and attract unique marine life. Cultivate a thriving ecosystem as you uncover the remnants of humanity lost beneath the waves.",
